WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:06.373 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Avec la bataille du Donbass,

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:07.907 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les Américains passent

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:09.409 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à l'artillerie lourde

00:00:06.473 --> 00:00:10.944 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour aider les Ukrainiens.

00:00:08.007 --> 00:00:12.479 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(tirs)

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:13.980 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Ils envoient des systèmes

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:15.548 size:53% position:73% line:53%
antiaériens, des missiles

00:00:12.579 --> 00:00:17.083 size:53% position:73% line:53%
antinavires...

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:18.585 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des drones kamikazes

00:00:15.649 --> 00:00:20.120 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Switchblade...

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:21.621 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et on ne lésine pas

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:23.189 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sur les coûts; l'enveloppe

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:24.691 size:53% position:73% line:53%
est de 3,4 milliards de dollars.

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:26.192 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Ici, dans cet entrepôt

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:27.727 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à Virginia Beach, on n'envoie

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:29.262 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pas des armes, mais du matériel

00:00:26.293 --> 00:00:30.764 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de protection. On y assemble

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:32.299 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des gilets pare-balles

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:35.001 size:53% position:73% line:53%
tous les jours...

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:35.001 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour les Ukrainiens

00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:35.001 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qui se battent au front.

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:50.350 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "Aujourd'hui, on fait

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:51.851 size:53% position:73% line:53%
1200 gilets, dit-i

00:00:43.777 --> 00:00:53.386 size:53% position:73% line:53%
c'est 2400 plaques, en tout."

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:54.921 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "Ce sont des plaques niveau 4,

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:56.423 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dit-il, ce qui est le plus

00:00:53.486 --> 00:00:57.957 size:53% position:73% line:53%
haut calibre contre des balles

00:00:55.021 --> 00:00:59.592 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour des soldats qui sont

00:00:56.523 --> 00:01:07.901 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sur la ligne de front."

00:00:58.058 --> 00:01:09.402 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Des casques et du matériel

00:00:59.693 --> 00:01:10.904 size:53% position:73% line:53%
médical sont aussi env...

00:01:08.001 --> 00:01:12.439 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Tout est emballé et acheminé

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:14.441 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en Pologne dans ce Boeing 777.

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:16.476 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Tous les sièges sont remplis;

00:01:12.539 --> 00:01:18.511 size:53% position:73% line:53%
24 heures plus tard,

00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:20.513 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le matériel arrive en Ukraine.

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:22.515 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Une opération qui a lieu

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:25.285 size:53% position:73% line:53%
tous les jours, nous dit-on,

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:27.287 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les besoins en Ukraine

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:28.822 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sont criants.

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:31.291 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "Chaque jour compte",

00:01:27.387 --> 00:01:32.492 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dit Jim Hake, le fondateur

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:33.727 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de Spirit of America,unununune t

00:01:31.391 --> 00:01:34.894 size:53% position:73% line:53%
non lucratif en collaboration

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:34.894 size:53% position:73% line:53%
avec le gouvernement américain.

00:01:33.827 --> 00:01:34.894 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "Notre objectif est de garder

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:41.634 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "Notre objectif est de garder

00:01:38.965 --> 00:01:43.136 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les Ukrainiens vivants", dit-il.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:45.171 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Une question de principe

00:01:41.735 --> 00:01:47.207 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour Jim Hake.

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:49.242 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "Ne soyons pas juste

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:54.581 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des observateurs impuissants,

00:01:47.307 --> 00:01:55.815 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dit-il, mais agissons pour

00:01:49.342 --> 00:01:57.016 size:53% position:73% line:53%
faire cesser cette souffrance."

00:01:54.681 --> 00:01:58.251 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Une souffrance qui n'est pas

00:01:55.915 --> 00:01:59.452 size:53% position:73% line:53%
près de cesser, selon Joe Biden,

00:01:57.117 --> 00:02:00.687 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qui prévoit une longue guerre.

00:01:58.351 --> 00:02:01.921 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "Je veux applaudir

00:01:59.552 --> 00:02:04.157 size:53% position:73% line:53%
votre travail exceptionnel,

00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:05.391 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dit-il aux hauts gradés

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:06.593 size:53% position:73% line:53%
militaires américains,

00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:11.397 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'armer et d'équiper

00:02:05.492 --> 00:02:12.899 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les braves Ukrainiens

00:02:06.693 --> 00:02:14.434 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qui défendent leur pays."

00:02:11.498 --> 00:02:28.281 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Une guerre par procuration

00:02:12.999 --> 00:02:30.316 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des États-Unis contre la Russie,

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:31.551 size:53% position:73% line:53%
diront certains, et toujours pas

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:32.585 size:53% position:73% line:53%
question d'envoyer des soldats

00:02:30.417 --> 00:02:33.586 size:53% position:73% line:53%
américains en sol ukrainien.

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:34.821 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Et la voie diplomatique

00:02:32.685 --> 00:02:36.823 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour une résolution du conflit

00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:38.057 size:53% position:73% line:53%
est de moins en moins évoquée.

00:02:34.921 --> 00:02:38.925 size:53% position:73% line:53%
CHRYSTIA FREELAND,

00:02:36.923 --> 00:02:39.793 size:53% position:73% line:53%
vice-première ministre du Canada

00:02:38.158 --> 00:02:40.827 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'est pour les Ukrainiens,

00:02:39.025 --> 00:02:41.828 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'être les leaders de

00:02:39.893 --> 00:02:42.862 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la diplomatie avec la Russie.

00:02:40.927 --> 00:02:43.897 size:53% position:73% line:53%
C'est la souveraineté de

00:02:41.928 --> 00:02:44.931 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'Ukraé é é é é é é violée.

00:02:42.962 --> 00:02:49.869 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mais on a une étroite

00:02:43.997 --> 00:02:51.404 size:53% position:73% line:53%
collaboration avec l'Ukraine.

00:02:45.031 --> 00:02:52.906 size:53% position:73% line:53%
On est là pour l'Ukraine.

00:02:49.969 --> 00:02:54.441 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le Canada réitère son soutien

00:02:51.504 --> 00:02:55.975 size:53% position:73% line:53%
militaire et économique

00:02:53.006 --> 00:02:57.477 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à l'Ukraine. En attendant,

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:59.012 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la guerre continue.

00:02:56.075 --> 00:03:00.547 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Spirit of America,

00:02:57.577 --> 00:03:02.048 size:53% position:73% line:53%
elle, espère faire sa part.

00:02:59.112 --> 00:03:03.583 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Une guerre qui perdure,

00:03:00.647 --> 00:03:05.118 size:53% position:73% line:53%
où un cessez-le-feu semble,

00:03:02.148 --> 00:03:05.652 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour le moment, illusoire.

00:03:03.683 --> 00:03:05.652 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Ici Azeb Wolde Giorghis,

00:03:05.218 --> 00:03:05.652 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Radio-Canada, Virginia Beac

